re-flex
------------------------------------------
High-performance C++ regex library and lexical analyzer generator with Unicode
support.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libreflex-devel-6.5.0-1bl1
  libreflex6-6.5.0-1bl1
  libreflexmin6-6.5.0-1bl1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/Genivia/RE-flex

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/Genivia/RE-flex/archive/refs/tags/v6.5.0.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack re-flex-6.5.0-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./re-flex-6.5.0-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/re-flex-6.5.0-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/re-flex-6.5.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libreflex6-6.5.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libreflexmin6-6.5.0-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libreflex-devel-6.5.0-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(re-flex)
  /usr/bin/reflex.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/re-flex.README
  /usr/share/doc/re-flex/LICENSE.txt
  /usr/share/doc/re-flex/README.md

